      ((paper_generated_trace_of_structure struct initialActive tallyOf).steps.get
        step).beforeActive)
    (fun step =>
      paper_generated_structure_step_candidate struct initialActive tallyOf step)
    exactFill budget uniqueBallotCount candidateCount

/--
Algorithm 3 exact-fill construction from candidate-indexed source allocations:
each added ballot lists the generated final order, keeping exactly the
candidates whose source allocation contains that voter. This is the concrete
